    "body": "> I would suggest we introduce an \"is online\" abstraction in Fetch as part of https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/pull/1852 and then make this getter return \"is online\".\n\nThe only concern is that in the fetch spec we would still need to invoke WebDriver BiDi twice: in fetch and in \"is online\" getter.",
